  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a tagine or heavy pot over medium heat.",
    "Add sliced onion and minced garlic, sauté until translucent.",
    "Stir in diced chicken and cook until lightly browned.",
    "Add carrot slices, chickpeas, tomato paste, cumin, smoked paprika, salt, and pepper; stir to coat.",
    "Pour in chicken broth, bring to a gentle simmer, cover, and cook for 20 minutes until vegetables are tender.",
    "Meanwhile, cut the iceberg lettuce head into wedges or large leaves.",
    "Gently fold the lettuce into the tagine, cover, and cook for an additional 5 minutes until just wilted.",
    "Serve hot, optionally garnish with fresh parsley or mint."
